# Kimi Code: skills are invoked as /skill:<name>; the context file is AGENTS.md;
# no per-subagent model hint, so Claude's `model:` tier clause is dropped (conventions §11.6);
# the question tool's multi-select field is snake_case.
CLAUDE\.md	AGENTS.md
CLAUDE	AGENTS
, `model:` the (?:READ|EXEC|PLAN) tier value, omitted when empty	
multiSelect	multi_select
subagent_type: Explore	subagent_type: explore
subagent_type: general-purpose	subagent_type: coder
headless or scripted runs	non-interactive `kimi -p` runs, no human to answer
headless / scripted	non-interactive `kimi -p`, no human to answer
无人值守 / 脚本化	非交互 `kimi -p` 下，无人应答
